{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/ModifiedContent"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/ModifiedContent\/defaultLaunchBehavior(_:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"text":"Sets the default launch behavior for this scene.","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"defaultLaunchBehavior"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"SceneLaunchBehavior","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI19SceneLaunchBehaviorV"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Scene","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP"}],"role":"symbol","title":"defaultLaunchBehavior(_:)","externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5ScenePAAE21defaultLaunchBehavioryQrAA0dfG0VF::SYNTHESIZED::s:11OpenSwiftUI15ModifiedContentV","roleHeading":"Instance Method","extendedModule":"OpenSwiftUI","symbolKind":"method"},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","kind":"attribute","text":"MainActor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"defaultLaunchBehavior"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"_"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"behavior"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI19SceneLaunchBehaviorV","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/SceneLaunchBehavior","text":"SceneLaunchBehavior"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene","text":"Scene"},{"kind":"text","text":"\n"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This behavior can be used to define if a scene is shown on application"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"launch in the absence of any previously saved state."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"On platforms that do not support multiple windows, this value is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ignored."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"On platforms other than Windows, there must be at least one scene that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presents itself. If no scenes are defined to present, the first scene"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"will be presented, regardless of the value provided to this modifier."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"During app launch, on platforms other than Windows, the system"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"will only consider scenes whose role matches the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"doc:\/\/com.apple.documentation\/documentation\/bundleresources\/information_property_list\/uiapplicationpreferreddefaultscenesessionrole"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"key in the application scene manifest of the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Info.plist"},{"type":"text","text":" file."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For instance, a volumetric window would need the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UIWindowSceneSessionRoleVolumetricApplication"},{"type":"text","text":" role."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Note","style":"note","type":"aside"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"On Windows, this behavior will also be used to determine which scene is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presented when clicking on the icon of a running application with no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"visible windows."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"On visionOS, the system may background the last dismissed scene instead"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of closing it. Thus, the suppressed behavior additionally specifies that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the scene should not be presented when tapping on the application icon"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with no visible windows."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For example, you may wish to present a welcome window on launch of your"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"app when there are no previous document windows being restored:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":null,"code":["@main","struct MyApp: App {","    var body: some Scene {","        DocumentGroup(newDocument: MyDocument()) { configuration in","            DocumentEditor(configuration.$document)","        }","","        Window(\"Welcome to My App\", id: \"welcome\") {","            WelcomeView()","        }","        .defaultLaunchBehavior(.presented)","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The default value for all scenes if you do not apply this modifier is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/SceneLaunchBehavior\/automatic","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". With that strategy, a scene"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"will only present itself if it is the first scene defined by the app,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and no other scenes have presented themselves."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/modifiedcontent\/defaultlaunchbehavior(_:)"]}],"references":{"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/ModifiedContent":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"ModifiedContent","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/ModifiedContent","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A value with a modifier applied to it."}],"title":"ModifiedContent","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/modifiedcontent","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ModifiedContent"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/SceneLaunchBehavior":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SceneLaunchBehavior","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/SceneLaunchBehavior","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The launch behavior for a scene."}],"title":"SceneLaunchBehavior","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/scenelaunchbehavior","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SceneLaunchBehavior","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/Scene":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Scene"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A part of an app’s user interface with a life cycle managed by the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"system."}],"title":"Scene","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/scene","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Scene"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/ModifiedContent/defaultLaunchBehavior(_:)":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"defaultLaunchBehavior","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"SceneLaunchBehavior","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI19SceneLaunchBehaviorV"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Scene","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/ModifiedContent\/defaultLaunchBehavior(_:)","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Sets the default launch behavior for this scene.","type":"text"}],"title":"defaultLaunchBehavior(_:)","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/modifiedcontent\/defaultlaunchbehavior(_:)","kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/SceneLaunchBehavior/automatic":{"fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"automatic","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI19SceneLaunchBehaviorV","text":"SceneLaunchBehavior","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/SceneLaunchBehavior\/automatic","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The automatic behavior."}],"title":"automatic","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/scenelaunchbehavior\/automatic","kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","role":"collection","abstract":[],"title":"OpenSwiftUI","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui","kind":"symbol","type":"topic"}}}